Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:18:48 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 15/55] Profiles on the 2858 dashboard: 2858 xam, config kept
 across hand-offs

- The console's xam.xex (loaded for its resources) now gets the system
  update's xam.xexp like the dashboard does. With the 1888 xam, the 2858
  dashboard's gamercard scene (GamerCard.xur) failed to build and its
  Format setter dereferenced a null object: black screen with a profile
  signed in, frozen dashboard after creating one.
- Dashboard/Guide hand-off exits save the config first, so the signed-in
  profile is remembered when a game starts.
- Debug: --debug_stack_dump_ms logs guest call stacks and registers;
  XexGetModuleSection logs its result at debug level.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AFb8CDFE1Ms5NnJH88eG8b
